# PostgreSQL Backup Cron Configuration
# Add this line to crontab using: crontab -e
#
# Backup database every day at 03:00 AM UTC
# 0 3 * * * cd /app && bash scripts/backup_db.sh >> logs/backup.log 2>&1
#
# Cron Expression Breakdown:
#   Minute:       0       (at minute 0)
#   Hour:         3       (at 03:00 AM)
#   Day of Month: *       (every day)
#   Month:        *       (every month)
#   Day of Week:  *       (every day of week)
#
# To install:
#   1. crontab -e
#   2. Paste: 0 3 * * * cd /app && bash scripts/backup_db.sh >> logs/backup.log 2>&1
#   3. Save and exit
#
# To verify installed cron jobs:
#   crontab -l
